This is an easy song to play.  About after Rivers Cuomo says
"all alone" and "axl rose", it does some chords that I had never
had experience with until I started playing Weezer, but it's still
not difficult, just have to use your pinky more.  Credit Kelly
Kristek with the solo, it's posted on OLGA
(http://ccwf.cc.utexas.edu/~wonsup/guitar/w/weezer/ ). Have fun.

